// The same shape as `business_hours.dw` with the window written backwards, so no time of day can
// satisfy it: after 17:00 AND before 09:00.
//
// THIS IS THE FIXTURE THAT PROVES THE CLOCK IS EVALUATED rather than merely admitted. A model that
// parsed `context.system.now.toTime()` and then treated it as an unconstrained value would report
// this permit live, exactly like the one beside it, and the two files would be indistinguishable.
// It must come back VACUOUS.
permit (
    principal,
    action == AgentCore::Action::"issue_refund",
    resource
)
when {
    context.system.now.toTime() >= duration("17h")
    && context.system.now.toTime() <= duration("9h")
};
